- sequence $C_{n}=\frac{1}{\max \left(a_{1}, b_{1}\right)}+\frac{1}{\max \left(a_{2}, b_{2}\right)}+\ldots+\frac{1}{\max \left(a_{n}, b_{n}\right)}$ is bounded.

