In our case, we apply this inequality in turn to the pairs $\left(x=\frac{1}{a}, y=\frac{1}{b}\right)$; $\left(x=\frac{1}{b}, y=\frac{1}{c}\right) ;\left(x=\frac{1}{c}, y=\frac{1}{a}\right)$.

